"""Health-inspect a restaurant kitchen line: grill, fryer, cold prep.

A patrol walker visits each station and runs two checks at every stop:
a temperature audit (anything above 40 C is a violation) and a visit log
(every station visited is recorded). Both checks fire at every station.
