"""Mutual friendships in a small neighborhood.

Houses are modeled as nodes; buddy edges are bidirectional, created in
a single statement. Two greeter walkers are spawned, one at each of the
two houses, and each uses forward traversal only to reach the other,
proving the link really points both ways. A guard set prevents bouncing
back and forth forever.
