"""Information governance and privacy register demo.

Models an information-asset register with classification, retention,
stewardship metadata, and data-flow relations. A walker audits the
register for missing stewardship, expired retention, and cross-boundary
data flows — surfacing the exact governance gaps that the issue
(#2887) asks the system to expose.
